  "howto": {
    "what": "装上后 Claude 可把任务交给本机 Ollama 模型：列出已装模型，向指定模型发提示并取回结果；开启管理工具后还能拉取、删除、查看模型及内存中已加载的模型。",
    "when": "当你要求用本地 Ollama 模型做推理，或提到列出、拉取模型等操作时，Claude 会调用这些工具接管。",
    "say": [
      {
        "text": "用 ollama 告诉我法国的首都是哪里",
        "note": "先列模型，再调用 ollama_generate"
      },
      {
        "text": "拉取 gemma3:1b 模型",
        "note": "需已开启 OLLAMA_ADMIN_TOOLS"
      },
      {
        "text": "现在内存里加载了哪些 ollama 模型？",
        "note": "调用 ollama_list_running"
      }
    ],
    "source": "llm",
    "content_hash": "sha256:cc0f2afb754f24b78383a1080783337a0e2542c5fab00183f0b62c22b4181365",
    "model": "deepseek-v4-flash",
    "generated_at": "2026-09-18T08:01:04.231Z",
    "lint_pass": true,
    "what_en": "Once installed, Claude can offload work to local Ollama models: it lists installed models and sends prompts to a chosen model via MCP tools. With OLLAMA_ADMIN_TOOLS=true it can also pull, delete, inspect, and list running models.",
    "when_en": "Triggers when you ask for an answer from a local Ollama model, or ask it to list or pull models.",
    "say_en": [
      {
        "text": "Use ollama to tell me the capital of France",
        "note": "Lists models, then calls ollama_generate"
      },
      {
        "text": "Pull the gemma3:1b model",
        "note": "Needs OLLAMA_ADMIN_TOOLS=true"
      },
      {
        "text": "Which ollama models are loaded in memory?",
        "note": "Calls ollama_list_running"
